# AIDEVCOURSE

Next.js App Router starter with TypeScript. The project uses Node.js 24 LTS.

## Codespaces

Open the repository in GitHub Codespaces. Dependencies are installed automatically with `npm ci`, and port 3000 is forwarded by the dev container.

## Commands

```bash
npm run dev
npm test
npm run build
```

The full command set is `dev`, `build`, `start`, `lint`, and `test`.

## Environment variables

Copy `.env.example` to `.env.local` and provide values when integrating Supabase:

```text
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
```
